	(text "TMC5160 in SPI motion-controller mode (SD_MODE=0, SPI_MODE=1), internal clock.\nSense resistors 50 mOhm -> 4.7 A RMS full scale; trim with GLOBALSCALER/IRUN.\nSRxL Kelvin lines: route R(SRAL)/R(SRBL) from the GND pad of each sense resistor.\nEach dual FET = one half-bridge: unit A high side (D=VM, S=BM), unit B low side (D=BM, S=sense)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
